## Project Objectives

Development of a commercial-scale green hydrogen production facility powered by renewable energy, serving industrial and transportation markets.

### Key Deliverables
1. 100 MW electrolyzer facility
2. Hydrogen storage (5,000 kg capacity)
3. Compression and dispensing station
4. Pipeline connection to industrial park
5. Renewable power integration

